# Frontend intentionally has no Vapi secrets or assistant ids.
# Voice sessions are initialized via authenticated backend endpoints.

# Optional dev-only override for the API base URL. Use this when adb reverse
# isn't available (e.g. wireless adb on a physical device) to point the app at
# your dev machine's LAN IP directly.
#
# Example:
# DEV_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.41:5000/
#
# Values must be https://, or http:// targeting localhost/127.0.0.1 or a
# private LAN address (10.x / 172.16-31.x / 192.168.x / *.local). Other http://
# values are rejected by the insecure-URL guard in src/api/client.js.
# Babel inlines this at build time — restart Metro with --reset-cache after
# changing the file.
